WEBVTT

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:30.962
Anyway, in that one simple sentence
to a short-sighted gym teacher

00:01:31.003 --> 00:01:32.797
"but you should see her,"

00:01:32.839 --> 00:01:37.301
my dad showed me that focusing
on strengths more than weaknesses

00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:38.803
feels really good.

00:01:39.387 --> 00:01:41.931
That there are other ways
to look at the world

00:01:41.973 --> 00:01:45.017
and that it's important
to recognize each other's gifts.

00:01:46.018 --> 00:01:47.895
So with all that great karma

00:01:47.937 --> 00:01:50.857
my dad had built up
around appreciation with me,

00:01:50.898 --> 00:01:54.777
it only seems right that some praise
would ultimately come his way.

00:01:55.361 --> 00:01:58.447
Long into his fruitful
and active retirement,

00:01:58.489 --> 00:02:01.117
he was featured in a hometown
newspaper story.